[00:02.000] 作词 : Arnold Lanni/Chuck Comeau/David Desrosiers/Jeff Stinco/Pierre Bouvier/Sébastien Lefebvre
[00:22.390]Sometimes I feel like everybody’s got a problem. (有时我觉得所有人都面对着难题)
[00:25.390]Sometimes I feel like nobody wants to solve them. (但我想没人解决他们)
[00:28.570]I know that people say we’re never gonna make it. (我知道他们说我们永远都做不到)
[00:31.640]But I know we’re gonna get through this (但我知道我们一定终将克服)
[00:34.320]
[00:34.660]Close your eyes and please don’t let me go. (闭上你的眼睛，请允许我留下)
[00:37.870]Don't Don't Don't, Don’t let me go now. (请不要让我离开)
[00:40.680]Close your eyes don’t let me let you go. (闭上你的眼睛，请允许我留下)
[00:43.940]Don't Don't Don't, Take my hand tonight (我不要离开，今夜请握住我的手。)
[00:49.220]Let’s not think about tomorrow. (让我们别再想明天)
[00:52.270]Take my hand tonight. (今夜只要握住我的手)
[00:55.220]We can find some place to go. (我们会找到可去的地方)
[00:58.560]Cause our hearts are locked forever. (因我们的心永久相连)
[01:01.640]And our love will never die. (我们的爱将永存世间)
[01:04.620]Take my hand tonight one last time. (今夜，最后一次握住我的手)
[01:10.090]
[01:11.230]Hey,Hey!!! (Hey,Hey!!!)
[01:12.240]
